        "code": {
          "text": "Swallowing difficulty"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports dysphagia for approximately 6–8 weeks, occurring most days; mainly with solids (meat and bread), much more than liquids. Food feels as if it stops halfway, at the mid-sternum. Needs to sip water to get food down and occasionally has to stop and wait. No complete blockage so far."
      }
